                    "copy": "®, ™ & © 2020 Lions Gate Entertainment Inc. All Rights Reserved. Bloober ®, ™ & © 2020 Bloober Team S.A. (Inc.) and Bloober Team NA. All Rights Reserved.",
                    "privacyPolicyLink": {
